Cell["\<\
When \[Lambda]->0,we get something in the form of the fixed points attaining \
Subscript[\[Mu], max].This suggests we should assume that \
x11,x12,x23,x24,y12,and y22 satisfy the equations in Section 1.In that \
case,we verify the complex moment maps:\
\>", "Text",
