Cell["\<\
Upper right entry is 0 by our assumption (since \[Mu]SL[x,y]=0 is satisfied \
when s1=s2=0), and the lower left entry is zero when s1 = x24 t and s2 = -x23 \
t .  This gives us a 1-dimensional \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]Hitchin section\
\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] parameterized by t, as expected.  We will use this \
parameterization below.\
\>", "Text",
