Cell["\<\
The above is the explicit description of the real symplectic form for the \
parabolic parameters \[Beta] = {1,1,2,3} and for real nonzero values of t.  \
Below is the actual tangent space parameterized by q11 and q13, and then the \
symplectic form for t=1 just to show how clean the answers are for numerical \
parameters.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.871750154057877*^9, 3.871750256253598*^9}, {
